'''Bambusicola''' (bam-bū-sik′ọ̄-lä), ''n.'' [NL., < ''bambusa'', bamboo, + L. ''colere'', inhabit.] A genus of gallinaceous birds of Asia, the bamboo-partridges. ''B. thoracica'' is a Chinese species; ''B. sonorivox'' is found in Formosa.

